om/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=skjhsCxbRQA\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=skjhsCxbRQA\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=skjhsCxbRQA </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>For different game play videos of White Wolf Games from my play group<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU...IhwsM3kHK56SRA</a><br /> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\">https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night</a><br /> If you want to find White Wolf game play media or subject matter media<br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","name":"ChristopherZacher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"631"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T07:43:04-07:00","id":1115089,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Hello Folks,</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">I would like to share with you our latest session of our World of Darkness chronicle The Ultimate Evil.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The group struggles to find the meaning behind the answers they were given, and try to follow the hints laid for them in the final chapter of The World of Darkness - The Ultimate Evil &quot;Remembrance&quot;. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Please subscribe and like the video if you enjoyed! Thank you!!</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">This is a Chronicles of Darkness 1st Edition game that takes place in 1987 in Bismarck, North Dakota and deals with the Satanic Panic of the 1980s. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kl9iEVYasl8</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Check us out on Soundcloud </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">We are also in the iTunes store and other Podcast apps!</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>For different game play videos of White Wolf Games from my play group<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU...IhwsM3kHK56SRA</a><br /> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\">https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night</a><br /> If you want to find White Wolf game play media or subject matter media<br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","name":"ChristopherZacher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"631"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-13T21:59:48-07:00","id":1115792,"title":"","content":"Hello Folks,<br /> <br /> A part of what we are trying to do on our channel is to not only provide original 3 hours actual play sessions, but also editing those 3 hours session into edited 1 hour sessions. With that known, I bring to you the first story arc in our World of Darkness \u2013 The Ultimate Evil chronicle called \u201cRemembrance\u201d.<br /> Its tells the story of a group of young men reunited after 10 years, all who lost a mentor they all shared in their childhood and find themselves reunited to help solve her murder.<br /> This game is a Chronicles of Darkness 1<sup>st</sup> Edition game, set in Bismarck, North Dakota in the fall of 1987. I\u2019m not going to lie when I say this game is very special to me for very many reasons. First, it takes place in a town I lived in for four years as a child. I get to re-visit a lot of locations, and even some real people that inspired some NPCS in the game. Second, two new players joined our group and I am privileged to have them. Third, I went way out of my comfort zone. I wanted to tell a story, with the help of the players, that was very grounded in character development and roleplaying. I had to think of grounded realistic interaction with NPCs on the fly, and I felt it help my limited toolbox as a story teller grow a little bit with the patient help of the players. Forth, I got to tackle something that scared me shitless as a child, The Satanic Panic, of the 1980s. In this story we deal with elements from different books dealing with the subject, including a book of the same name as this chronicle, and pay homage to a poor young lady who had her life take from her in the 70s.<br /> I hope you enjoy this game as much as the players and I did. I know it wasn\u2019t the normal Vampire: The Masquerade games I run, but thank you for those who have and will try the story out.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlI7udTBmjbFc0YQLZDqzcmi9pp5db0sY\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlI7udTBmjbFc0YQLZDqzcmi9pp5db0sY\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlI7udTBmjbFc0YQLZDqzcmi9pp5db0sY\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlI7udTBmjbFc0YQLZDqzcmi9pp5db0sY </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Check us out on Soundcloud<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\"> https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> We are also in the iTunes store and other Podcast apps!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>For different game play videos of White Wolf Games from my play group<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU...IhwsM3kHK56SRA</a><br /> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\">https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night</a><br /> If you want to find White Wolf game play media or subject matter media<br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","name":"ChristopherZacher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"631"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-07T09:03:32-07:00","id":1204194,"title":"","content":"Hello Folks,<br /> <br /> I just wanted to take a moment to share our recently re-edited podcast for our Chronicles of Darkness story \u201cThe Ultimate Evil\u201d.<br /> <br /> This story is very special to me because it originally started off as an experiment of sorts to take a deep dive into roleplaying and character development. I wanted to have very grounded and realistic NPCs that would make the characters feel real, which would also in the end highlight the horror of the story even more.<br /> <br /> It takes place in Bismarck, North Dakota in the fall of 1987 and deals somewhat with the Satanic Panic of the 80s. I lived in Bismarck during this time as a child for our years, so a lot of the places where this story took place I actually had been at in real life. I also tried to incorporate real locations and history too that I had researched.<br /> <br /> The story is also very heavily inspired by the Satanic Panic of the 1980s and a book also called \u201cThe Ultimate Evil\u201d written by Maury Terry that goes into this off the wall conspiracy that the Son of Sam was part of a huge Satanic cult, one that even reached as far as Bismarck, North Dakota. In the book the author talks about a sad story of a young lady who lost her life that was from Bismarck and in the game we try to honor her memory in the best way possible.<br /> <br /> If you happen to check this out, I really hope you enjoy it. I think it\u2019s a gem that often doesn\u2019t get the attention our other stories due since it is from one of the smaller World of Darkness game lines.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night/sets/world-of-darkness-the-ultimate\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night/sets/world-of-darkness-the-ultimate\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night/sets/world-of-darkness-the-ultimate\" target=\"_blank\"> https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night/sets/world-of-darkness-the-ultimate </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Please subscribe, and review if you enjoy the podcast.<br /> <br /> Check us out on iTunes:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/twin-cities-by-night/id1246523585?mt=2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/twin-cities-by-night/id1246523585?mt=2\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/twin-cities-by